  triage:note "AICH-S5-QA-5 (PR #640): independently re-verified by quality-mgr and ruthless-boundary-qa. resolve_peer_authority no longer exists in https_transport.rs (grep confirmed); lives in new runtime_health/peer_authority.rs; post_write_router.rs is the only workspace caller and imports the new location. Boundary violation resolved on this branch." ;
  triage:occursIn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s25/96377687> .

